:: office speaker=clerk
:match trust_of(clerk)
  :case friendly
    > @office_friendly
      Your name is here, written in my own hand last spring.
  :case wary
    > @office_wary
      I see a name. Whether it is yours is another question.
-> arrival

:: arrival speaker=narrator
> @arrival_line
  The far bank appears all at once, as if the fog had been holding it back.
-> END
